    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What happens when you give post-apocalyptic survivors high-tech hover tanks and let them fight it out for dwindling resources?\u00a0 You get Mad Max meets the WWE!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow your friends up in this wild and explosive post-apocalyptic local split-screen multiplayer game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568640/extras/5ce50611e69a993c4acf94571b5f417a.avif?t=1748003028\" width=616 height=124 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 player split-screen local\u00a0multiplayer (and online\u00a0via\u00a0Steam\u00a0Remote\u00a0Play\u00a0Together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 player elimination mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2v2\u00a0team\u00a0match mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible terrain</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568640/extras/b2672080e81bd13bb782ac09a81cb73f.avif?t=1748003028\" width=616 height=124 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player\u00a0training missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible objects</p></li></ul>",
